; WHO 4 thermoregulation: the zone-level WHAT values a gateway forwards, on the zone
; (*4*WHAT*1##) and on the zone's control-unit form (*4*WHAT*#1##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: the same values on
; both WHERE forms, WHAT 0..3, 40, 50, 99..104, 201..203, 255, 301..304, 310..312, 1000,
; 4000..4003, 9999.
